{"parse": {"title": "AFF-09", "pageid": 123503, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-08\" title=\"AFF-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFF-09</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFF-10\" title=\"AFF-10\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">09</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.85.88.E8.A7.89.E8.80.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"先觉者\">先觉者</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 先觉者</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Seer</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>现<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>禁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>止<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谈<span class=\"color-value\"></span>论<span class=\"color-value\"></span>命<span class=\"color-value\"></span>运<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>噢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span>别<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>快<span class=\"color-value\"></span>食<span class=\"color-value\"></span>言<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3210109</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>西莉亚？西莉亚？……果然不在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉转向了隔壁的门，从口袋中摸出一把钥匙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>只好先在我家找找了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_2_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_2_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-3_2_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>公寓里的物件比起水晶工房还要多，只是它们没有水晶那般璀璨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>未经打磨的原石、展览会的宣传册、城市道路地图和下水道地图、修理机械的各种工具……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>嗯……让我找找，西莉亚有不少东西是放在我这儿的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在积木般整齐码放的小玩意之中，贝丽尔的目光锁定了一张被装裱好的照片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-313411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-313411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-313411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>这是你和西莉亚吗？看上去，你们关系很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑白照片中的形象仍旧鲜活，一个小女孩兴致勃勃，另一个则紧张得快跑出镜头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-313510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-313510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/84/HeadIconSmall-313510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>当然。老爸老妈忙于他们的大冒险，我俩差不多是一块儿长大。小时候我没少出现在她家的饭桌上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉一边逐个拉开抽屉，一边应答着贝丽尔的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>西莉亚表面文静，但我知道她其实比谁都勇敢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-313501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>现在，比起我来，她的志向可远大得多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>怎么回事，想找时一个东西也找不到……用这个行不行？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉从最下方的抽屉中抱出一摞信件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信件的邮票来自世界各处，信封却差异不大，上面都写着出奇工整的一行字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“女儿阿黛拉·塔沃尼尔收”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔拿起一封仔细端详。邮票的边角已经翘起，略微泛黄，与崭新的信封格格不入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>贝丽尔女士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉忍不住催促。她不喜欢贝丽尔了然的神色，也不想在此时谈论信件的来历。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>这些信……好的，当然可以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看了看阿黛拉脚边空着的抽屉。它在最常使用的书桌最不起眼的角落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你的父母很久没有回到巴黎了。比起他们，你与西莉亚的确会更加熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>没什么大不了的，他们在我人生中存在的时间本就不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我明白了。我会尽力为你找到你重要的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她开始一封封翻阅信件，只像是日常生活的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到双眼开始失焦，她的动作也不曾停下，只是摸索过、阅览过每一个字母，从中捕捉不可见的辉光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，光线落回了她的眼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你的友人被这座城市吞没，坠入幽暗的洞穴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>大瘟疫的遗产，地下的另一个世界……与起舞的亡灵同在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>吞没……坠入……地下的另一个世界……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出租车司机的眉头紧紧拧着，随后豁然开朗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>噢，是地下墓穴！对了，她昨天说过要去研究死亡之舞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>她现在一定在地下墓穴能观察到那些骷髅壁画的地方！该死，她以前就喜欢往这些地方跑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>您的用词真是吓了我一跳，我还以为她是真去了另一个世界呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>确认目标的年轻人没有踌躇，立刻奔向了公寓门。占卜师却叫住了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>——我在她的命运中也见到了你，阿黛拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>如果你仍要前往，前方注定会有牺牲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这并非提醒，而是陈述。<br />她隐约感觉到，贝丽尔似乎的确能看见一些遥远的事物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她只是笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>从小到大，这种话我听得太多了。<br />我可不能为了一句缥缈的预示就放弃西莉亚，放弃我想弄明白的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我尊重命运的方式，就是听从自己的判断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔仍然平静地看着她，那透明的目光让阿黛拉有一种古怪的感觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎贝丽尔的目光并不在当下，而是更加遥远的某处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻后，她勾起嘴角，声音一如平日的优雅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>——是了，你是会如此回答。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_2_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_2_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_2_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两人回到了公寓楼下，司机逐渐放缓走向爱车的脚步，似乎这能让时间变慢。<br />虽然得到了好友的位置，但她心中的疑惑并未减少分毫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……贝丽尔女士，对占卜师而言，梦境是否可控？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>物质可以是劣化的精神，精神也可以只是较高的物质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>而有形的物质终究是可以交互与干涉的，这个回答如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那就是说，控制梦境，对您这样的占卜师并不算难事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直逼核心的发问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔偏过头，神色如常。这句话远不够锋利，无法划破她的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>阿黛拉小姐，我不曾操纵过你的梦境。<br />如果你不愿相信，我们本也不必进行这番占卜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>不。我没有不相信您的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>只是梦境成真这件事实在难以置信，而您又是对此最为了解的人。<br />恰好，我最近只接触过两个占卜师，其中一个已经死了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>没关系。换做是我，也会有类似的怀疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>感谢您的理解……请上车吧。您住在哪里？我一定为您规划一条最快的线路——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_11\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_2_at_11.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_2_at_11.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_2_at_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她打开副驾驶的车门，尽到优秀司机的礼仪，却发现已有人占了座位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/HeadIconSmall-313520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>费利西安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>真是让我好等！你想怎么辩解？阿黛拉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一位失踪人士的及时出现令阿黛拉松了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313522.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-313522.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313522.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313522.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-313522.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313522.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-313522.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313522.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>我的大小姐，现在到处都在闹罢工。你这样满身贵族气质，可不能到处乱走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313531.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-313531.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313531.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313531.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-313531.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313531.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-313531.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313531.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>不对，你的项链从哪儿来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>别岔开话题。你把我忘到现在的理由呢？不说些什么维护你的忠诚和名誉么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大小姐轻巧地拿起一枚马卡龙，舌头则编织着苛刻的单词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-313515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-313515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7a/HeadIconSmall-313515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>那是西莉亚给我的项链！怎么会在你这里？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿黛拉赶紧伸手摸入口袋，却发现里面空空如也。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_03\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_2_bg_03.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_2_bg_03.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_2_bg_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>费利西安放下了手中的甜点，举起了胸前的项链。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-640901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-640901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-640901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>哈？西莉亚给你的？难道你不是法国人？还是你真的蠢到无以复加？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_11\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_2_at_11.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_2_at_11.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_2_at_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640919.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640919.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>我再向你说明一次，给我好好刻在你的脑子里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640919.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640919.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>这是我的东西！我亲自找回的宝物，是我一生中冒险的最高收获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640919.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640919.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-640919.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640919.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>没有被未来伤害的，巴隆家的宿愿，那美好时代的遗物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"640918.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"640918.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-640918.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-640918.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">费利西安：</div><div>这是我的宝石！明白么？我的，我的，我的！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_11\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_2_at_11.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_2_at_11.png/900px-Cg-3_2_at_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-3_2_at_11.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_at_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高傲的小姐将宝石一把攥住。她注视着阿黛拉，愤怒的语气却没有配上愤怒的视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像是发现了一件不堪用，甚至没有资格承受怒火的工具。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_16.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_16\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_16\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_2_bg_16.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_16.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_2_bg_16.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_16.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/Cg-3_2_bg_16.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_16.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>你说……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>阿黛拉小姐，你还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔从身后扶住了摇摇欲坠的司机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你还在担心那位“费利西安”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>什么担心？她就在这儿！你到底怎么了，费利西安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>……费利西安？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔顺着她手指的方向望向副驾驶席。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——她的声音停顿了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_at_12_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_at_12_zone\"><img alt=\"3_2_at_12_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Cg-3_2_at_12_zone.png/600px-Cg-3_2_at_12_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"736\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/56/Cg-3_2_at_12_zone.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"880\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313419.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313419.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313419.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313419.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313419.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313419.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313419.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313419.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>可是……阿黛拉小姐，你看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313419.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313419.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313419.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313419.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313419.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313419.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-313419.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313419.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>副驾驶席上并没有任何人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-313414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-313414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-313414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>你打开车门之后，就一直在和空气争吵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>半晌，阿黛拉才取回自己的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313522.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-313522.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313522.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313522.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-313522.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313522.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-313522.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313522.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿黛拉：</div><div>………………咦？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFF-09"}}